  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual contributions to the Commonwealth Secretariat FY2025/26 - ODA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Commonwealth Secretariat established in 1965 is the principal intergovernmental organisation of the Commonwealth of Nations. Members make contributions to the core fund which are determined by an agreed scale of assessed contributions, based on the UN Scales of Assessment system. The fund&#x2019;s purpose is to facilitate consultation and consensus-building amongst Commonwealth governments. It supports works that allows ComSec to monitor international developments, conduct research and prepare briefings on political, social and economic issues which are of interest to member countries; and achieve the delivery of outcomes in fulfilment of CHOGM (Commonwealth Heads of Government Meeting) mandates and commitments.</narrative>
  </description>
